+// A forward frame-sequence gap this size or smaller is recovered by continuing to decode
+// (a brief artifact the next keyframe wipes); a larger desync hard-waits for a clean
+// keyframe. ~0.5 s of frames at 60 fps.
+#define SOFT_GAP_MAX 30
+// Re-ask for an outstanding (asked-for but not-yet-arrived) keyframe no more than this
+// often, and only one at a time. The old path re-sent a full IDR every 200 ms, which
+// congested the uplink and, when a large IDR fragment was itself lost, deepened the stall.
+#define KEYFRAME_REREQUEST_MS 500
